scoreboard players operation #itemvalue 20min.s /= #quota 20min.s
execute if score #itemvalue 20min.s matches ..0 run scoreboard players set #itemvalue 20min.s 1
# Restate the ask as what finishes the interval from NOW. Rolling a quota against the
# full 24000 while 13 minutes have already elapsed asks for three times what is needed.
